# Paths Opengrep skips, gitignore syntax. The repo .gitignore is honored
# separately (node_modules, dist, .venv, …), so this only adds source-tree
# paths that are committed but not ours to lint.
#
# Generated code — authored by codegen, not by us.
**/_generated/
*.gen.ts
# Handlebars scaffolding, not real source.
tools/plop/templates/
# Built-in seed configs are data, not code — excluded per domain (the
# --exclude mapping in tools/opengrep/run.sh has no negation support) so the
# one first-party code workspace nested under builtin-configs/skills/
# (visual-aspect-analyzer, baked into the sandbox-runtime image) stays
# scanned. First-party skill code stays scanned.
builtin-configs/agents/
builtin-configs/automations/
builtin-configs/branding/
builtin-configs/governance/
builtin-configs/integrations/
builtin-configs/prompts/
builtin-configs/providers/
builtin-configs/token-sources/
builtin-configs/workflows/
# The document skills are vendored (Anthropic's office tooling) — their
# XML-parsing findings are accepted-risk in the sandboxed document tool.
builtin-configs/skills/docx/
builtin-configs/skills/pdf/
builtin-configs/skills/pptx/
builtin-configs/skills/xlsx/
# Test scaffolding & fixtures intentionally contain odd inputs (fake API keys,
# wildcard postMessage, etc.). SAST targets shipped production code.
**/fixtures/
**/__mocks__/
**/e2e/
tests/stress/
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.browser.test.ts
**/*.spec.ts
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py
**/conftest.py
# Agent review/scratch output (review logs, scan dumps) — generated artifacts,
# never source. Untracked so CI never sees them, but a local working tree may;
# excluding keeps the local scan identical to the CI gate.
.agents/review-out/
# Generated skill trees (`bun run skills:sync`): the .agents projection of
# visual-aspect-analyzer and the whole .claude mirror duplicate code that is
# already scanned at its builtin-configs/skills/ source.
.agents/skills/visual-aspect-analyzer/
.claude/skills/
# Static assets and vendored/minified bundles are not our source to lint.
**/public/
**/storybook-static/
*.min.js
*.min.css
# Markdown content (docs prose / translations) is not code.
docs/
